null,"start":0,"end":53},{"id":"liusima-q-62e6d7e0d2e27ee2883c","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-f52b6746a191b1bb7c2e","layer":"original","quote":"时天连雨，城欲崩，于是以苫蓑覆之。夜燃脂，照城外，视贼所作而为备","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":48},{"id":"wudi-e-o122a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c35781bdeff07231cb61","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，孙权为备攻合肥〖13〗。公自江陵征备，至巴丘〖14〗。遣张憙救合肥〖15〗，权闻憙至，乃走。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":664,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50},{"id":"wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o119","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。作玄武池以肄舟师〖2〗。﹝一﹞汉罢三公官，置丞相、御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"wudi-q-o122","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c35781bdeff07231cb61","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，孙权为备攻合肥〖13〗。公自江陵征备，至巴丘〖14〗。遣张憙救合肥〖15〗，权闻憙至，乃走。公至赤壁〖16〗，与备战，不利；于是大疫，吏士多死者。乃引军还，备遂有荆州江南诸郡〖17〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":664,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o016a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8156952936e37624c639","layer":"original","quote":"权自率众围合肥〖20〗。使张昭攻九江之当涂〖21〗，昭兵不利。权攻城逾月，不能下。曹公自荆州还，遣张喜将骑赴合肥；未至，权退。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o016","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8156952936e37624c639","layer":"original","quote":"权自率众围合肥〖20〗。使张昭攻九江之当涂〖21〗，昭兵不利。权攻城逾月，不能下。曹公自荆州还，遣张喜将骑赴合肥；未至，权退。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
